  salient="The accumulated error is below $448b\\,2^{-b+\\gamma}$ because precision $p=6b$ is spent as follows: the exact scalings contribute about $2^{2b+4}S\\,T^2\\le2^{5b+4}$ and the Gaussian normalization $2^\\gamma$ with $\\gamma=o(b)$, leaving a net $2^{-b+\\gamma}$ below $1/2$.",
